ext","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"max"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"p"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≤ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≤ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":". Similarly we can define "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Rmax"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"p"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Rmin"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"p"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Lmin"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"p"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For simplicity we only cares about case 1 and case 4. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In Case 1, we iterate over the start position of the segment, so we know the maximum and minimum number so we can compute the length of the segment and check the corresponding segment using "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Rmin"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Rmax"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In Case 4, we iterate over the start position again, denoted as "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Suppose the right end is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"y"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", then we know th